  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Frenzied Slaughterers" id="735d-b41a-8e24-c6e0" hidden="false">
      <description>Chunari Units you control can become Frenzied during the course of the game.


During the game, each time a Chunari Unit destroys and enemy model, mark down the maximum health of that model, and add that number to your units Frenzy counter total. Once a unit has gained 6 or more Frenzy counters then the unit is considered to be Frenzied.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
