          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the strategy phase, the Beast Master may split this unit into two units, one containing the Beast Master model and one containing the Pet Dog model, with new Starting Strengths accordingly.


